ssions are scheduled, and quality assurance checks are completed.\n\nBeyond oncology, **TREATMENT PLANNING** can include dental and orthodontic planning, where imaging such as a Panorex is used to plan interventions (e.g., dentures, braces, extractions, implants). Across all uses, **TREATMENT PLANNING** relies on organized records and clear communication to translate test results and patient factors (including overall health and early- vs advanced-stage disease) into a coherent, individualized care strategy.", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": null, "function_call": null}, "provider_specific_fields": {"native_finish_reason": "stop"}}], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 423, "prompt_tokens": 968, "total_tokens": 1391, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": null}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 0, "text_tokens": null, "image_tokens": null}}, "service_tier": null}}}